@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `law08-vintage`
IMPORT `law08-nouns`

-- Chuong III, Muc 1-2 (Dieu 64-83): conditions for a licence, ownership, the licence procedure and time limits,
-- official operation, changes, revocation, representative offices, governance and officers. Law 139/2025/QH15
-- changes this part in seven places, each a dated arm: Dieu 64(1)(a) and (4) repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 69
-- repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 71(3) repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 73 replaced (Dieu 1(3)); Dieu 74(3)(b) amended
-- (Dieu 1(4)); Dieu 81 replaced (Dieu 1(5)); Dieu 82(4) and (6) amended (Dieu 1(6)).
-- Amounts are VND or US dollars as the Law writes them: "2.000 ty Dong" is 2,000 billion = 2 trillion VND; "02 ty
-- Do la My" is 2 billion US dollars. The Government fixes the minimum charter capital and minimum total assets (inputs).

§ `Chuong III, Muc 1: Giay phep thanh lap va hoat dong`

§§ `Dieu 64: general conditions for a licence`

-- Dieu 64(1). V1: (a) the right to found and manage an enterprise (Law on Enterprises); (b) an organisation
-- is a lawful legal person, and if it contributes 10% or more of charter capital it was profitable in each of
-- the latest 3 consecutive financial years and meets the Government's financial conditions; (c) a licensed
-- insurer or reinsurer founding a new one was profitable for 3 years and meets the capital adequacy ratio.
-- Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) repeals (a) from V2; the right to contribute is then Dieu 3(3).
@@q 1166 1179
@@qa 336 337
@ref Dieu 64 (src:1166-1179; src:law139-2025-qh15:336-337)
GIVEN f IS A `A founding shareholder or member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 64(1): the founder meets the conditions` f MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN `the founder meets limbs (b) and (c)` f
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN f's `has the right to found and manage an enterprise in Vietnam under the Law on Enterprises` AND `the founder meets limbs (b) and (c)` f
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

GIVEN f IS A `A founding shareholder or member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the founder meets limbs (b) and (c)` f MEANS
        (   (NOT f's `is an organisation with legal personality that operates lawfully`)
         OR f's `contribution as a share of charter capital` BELOW 10%
         OR (    f's `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application`
             AND f's `meets the financial conditions the Government sets`))
    AND (   (NOT f's `is an insurer or reinsurer already licensed in Vietnam`)
         OR (    f's `was profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years to the date of the application`
             AND f's `meets the capital adequacy ratio under this Law`))

-- Dieu 64(2): charter capital in Vietnamese dong not below the Government's minimum, and no borrowed or entrusted funds.
@@q 1180 1184
@ref Dieu 64 (src:1180-1184)
GIVEN a IS A `A licence application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 64(2): the capital conditions are met` a MEANS
    CONSIDER a's `minimum charter capital the Government sets`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN REFUSE "Dieu 64(2)(a) requires charter capital not below the minimum the Government sets; no minimum is supplied"
    WHEN JUST m THEN     a's `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong`
                     AND a's `charter capital` AT LEAST m
                     AND (NOT a's `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others`)

-- Dieu 64(3): the personnel expected. Dieu 64(4), V1 only: an organisational form this Law provides and a draft charter.
@@q 1185 1190
@ref Dieu 64 (src:1185-1190)
GIVEN a IS A `A licence application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 64(3): the personnel condition is met` a MEANS
    a's `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81`

GIVEN a IS A `A licence application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 64(4): the form of organisation and the draft charter are in order` a MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN REFUSE "Dieu 64(4) is repealed by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) from 1 January 2026"
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN a's `has an organisational form this Law provides` AND a's `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises`
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

§§ `Dieu 65: members of a limited liability insurer`

-- Dieu 65. A member must be an organisation that meets Dieu 64 and: if established under foreign law, the five
-- conditions (a)-(dd) with total assets of at least 2 billion US dollars in the year before the application;
-- if established under Vietnamese law, total assets of at least 2,000 billion VND in that year. The
-- Government fixes the minimum "for each period" on the basis of those figures (Dieu 65(3)); if it supplies one
-- the member must also reach it (fork F26).
@@q 1194 1228
@ref Dieu 65 (src:1194-1228)
GIVEN m IS A `A member of a limited liability insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 65: the member of the limited liability insurer meets the conditions` m MEANS
        m's `is an organisation`
    AND m's `meets the general conditions of Dieu 64`
    AND (   IF m's `is established under foreign law`
            THEN     m's `is a foreign insurer, reinsurer or financial or insurance group`
                 AND m's `a foreign authority confirmed no serious breach of insurance law in the latest 3 consecutive years`
                 AND m's `has itself or through a subsidiary run the intended field for the latest 7 consecutive years`
                 AND m's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000
                 AND m's `committed to financial, technological, governance, risk, management and operational support and to the Law's financial safety rules`
            ELSE m's `total assets in the year before the application, in Vietnamese dong` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000_000)
    AND `the member reaches the Government's minimum if one is supplied` m

GIVEN m IS A `A member of a limited liability insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the member reaches the Government's minimum if one is supplied` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m's `minimum total assets the Government specifies for the period`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST g THEN IF m's `is established under foreign law`
                      THEN m's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST g
                      ELSE m's `total assets in the year before the application, in Vietnamese dong` AT LEAST g

§§ `Dieu 66: shareholders of a joint stock insurer`

@@q 1231 1242
@ref Dieu 66 (src:1231-1242)
GIVEN s IS A `The shareholders of a joint stock insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 66: the shareholders of the joint stock insurer meet the conditions` s MEANS
        s's `number of organisation shareholders each holding 10% or more of charter capital and meeting Dieu 65` AT LEAST 2
    AND s's `largest holding of one individual as a share of charter capital` AT MOST 10%

§§ `Dieu 67: a foreign branch`

@@q 1245 1276
@ref Dieu 67 (src:1245-1276)
GIVEN b IS A `A foreign branch applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 67(1)-(2): the foreign branch applicant meets the conditions` b MEANS
        b's `is a non-life insurer or a reinsurer`
    AND b's `the head office is in a country with a treaty with Vietnam allowing branches, and its regulator signed an agreement with the Ministry of Finance`
    AND b's `the home regulator allowed the branch within the lines the parent may carry on`
    AND b's `years of experience in the field intended` AT LEAST 7
    AND b's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000
    AND b's `profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years and meets the financial conditions the Government sets`
    AND b's `undertook to guarantee and answer for all obligations of the branch`
    AND b's `capital allocated in Vietnamese dong`
    AND `the allocated capital reaches the Government's minimum` b
    AND b's `capital is lawful and not borrowed or entrusted`
    AND b's `has a branch director and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81`

GIVEN b IS A `A foreign branch applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the allocated capital reaches the Government's minimum` b MEANS
    CONSIDER b's `minimum allocated capital the Government sets`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN REFUSE "Dieu 67(2)(a) requires allocated capital not below the minimum the Government sets; no minimum is supplied"
    WHEN JUST m THEN b's `allocated capital` AT LEAST m

@@q 1277 1279
@ref Dieu 67 (src:1277-1279)
`Dieu 67(3) — a licensed foreign branch may operate like an insurer or reinsurer established under this Law (a status provision; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Same operating rights as a domestic insurer."

§§ `Dieu 68: foreign ownership`

@@q 1281 1282
@ref Dieu 68 (src:1281-1282)
GIVEN `the share of charter capital held by foreign investors` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 68: the foreign holding is permitted` `the share of charter capital held by foreign investors` MEANS
    `the share of charter capital held by foreign investors` AT MOST 100%

§§ `Dieu 69: the dossier`

-- Dieu 69 lists six documents of the dossier. Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) repeals it from V2; the list is then
-- unwritten (Dieu 70(1) and 71(4) still speak of a "valid dossier" and a Government decree on the dossier).
@@q 1284 1305
@@qa 336 337
@ref Dieu 69 (src:1284-1305; src:law139-2025-qh15:336-337)
GIVEN d IS A `A licence dossier`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 69: the dossier contains the documents the Law lists` d MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN REFUSE "Dieu 69 is repealed by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) from 1 January 2026; the contents of the dossier are no longer listed in the Law"
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN     d's `has the written application`
                AND d's `has the draft charter or draft rules of organisation`
                AND d's `has the 5-year operating plan with the lines, risk governance, reserves, reinsurance, investment and solvency`
                AND d's `has the CVs, criminal records and qualifications of the proposed chair, chief executive, legal representative and actuary`
                AND d's `has the capital contribution, the list of holders of 10% or more and proof they meet Dieu 64-67`
                AND d's `has the list of beneficial owners`
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 69(6): the Government's criteria for a beneficial owner` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 69(6) delegates the criteria for a beneficial owner to the Government; its decree is not among the sources"

§§ `Dieu 70: time limit for granting a licence`

@@q 1307 1313
@ref Dieu 70 (src:1307-1313)
GIVEN l IS A `A licence decision`
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 70(1): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to grant or refuse` l MEANS
    l's `date the Ministry of Finance received the complete and valid dossier` PLUS 60

GIVEN l IS A `A licence decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 70(1): the Ministry of Finance decided in time and, if it refused, said so in writing with reasons` l MEANS
        l's `date the Ministry of Finance granted or refused` AT MOST `Dieu 70(1): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to grant or refuse` l
    AND l's `the refusal was notified in writing with reasons`

§§ `Dieu 71: authority over the licence`

@@q 1316 1330
@ref Dieu 71 (src:1316-1330)
`Dieu 71(1)-(2) — the licence is also the enterprise registration certificate; the Ministry of Finance grants, re-grants, amends, revokes it and suspends part or all of the activity (a statement of authority; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "One document, one authority."

@@q 1322 1326
@@qa 336 337
@ref Dieu 71 (src:1322-1326; src:law139-2025-qh15:336-337)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 71(3): the Ministry of Finance has notified the provincial business registration office in writing` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN REFUSE "Dieu 71(3) is repealed by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) from 1 January 2026"
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN REFUSE "Dieu 71(3) is a duty of the Ministry of Finance whose performance is a fact not supplied; no date is fixed for it"
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

@@q 1327 1330
@ref Dieu 71 (src:1327-1330)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 71(4): the Government's rules on the dossier, order and procedure of licensing` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 71(4) delegates the dossier, order and procedure to the Government; its decree is not among the sources"

§§ `Dieu 72: publishing the licence`

@@q 1332 1342
@ref Dieu 72 (src:1332-1342)
GIVEN l IS A `A licence decision`
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 72(1): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to publish the licence` l MEANS
    l's `date the licence was granted` PLUS 30

GIVEN l IS A `A licence decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 72(1): the Ministry of Finance published in time` l MEANS
    l's `date the Ministry of Finance published the licence` AT MOST `Dieu 72(1): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to publish the licence` l

GIVEN l IS A `A licence decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 72(2): the insurer published the licence at least 30 days before official operation in the way required` l MEANS
        l's `date the insurer published the licence and the planned date of official operation` AT MOST (l's `date of official operation` MINUS 30)
    AND l's `published in 3 consecutive issues of a printed newspaper or in an online newspaper`

§§ `Dieu 73: before official operation`

-- Dieu 73(1), V1 and V2: begin official operation within 12 months of the licence, unless force majeure or an
-- objective obstacle; then on written report and the Ministry's written approval the time is extended by at most 12 months.
@@q 1344 1351
@@qa 43 52
@ref Dieu 73 (src:1344-1351; src:law139-2025-qh15:43-52)
GIVEN p IS A `Preparation for official operation`
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 73(1): the last day to begin official operation` p MEANS
    CONSIDER p's `months of extension the Ministry of Finance approved in writing for force majeure or an objective obstacle`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `add months` (p's `date the licence was granted`) 12
    WHEN JUST n THEN IF n AT MOST 12 THEN `add months` (p's `date the licence was granted`) (12 PLUS n) ELSE REFUSE "Dieu 73(1): the extension is at most 12 months"

-- Dieu 73(2)-(3), V1: six things to be done to begin official operation, notified to the Ministry at least 15 days
-- before; V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(3)): five things the insurer does on its own initiative, notified 15 days before,
-- with the Ministry's power to suspend. V2 drops the premises and technology limb and the publication limb.
@@q 1352 1376
@@qa 53 68
@ref Dieu 73 (src:1352-1376; src:law139-2025-qh15:53-68)
GIVEN p IS A `Preparation for official operation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 73: the conditions for official operation are met` p MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN     p's `the capital was paid in full`
                AND p's `the legal representative and the officers approved in principle were elected or appointed`
                AND p's `the organisation, management, internal control, internal audit and risk systems were built and officers elected or appointed`
                AND p's `internal rules and basic business procedures were issued`
                AND p's `the deposit was made in full at a commercial bank`
                AND p's `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance that these were done` AT MOST (p's `date of official operation` MINUS 15)
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN     p's `the blocked capital was turned into charter or allocated capital`
                AND p's `the organisation, management, internal control, internal audit and risk systems were built and officers elected or appointed`
                AND p's `the legal representative and the officers approved in principle were elected or appointed`
                AND p's `internal rules and basic business procedures were issued`
                AND p's `the deposit was made in full at a commercial bank`
                AND p's `premises, facilities and technology fit the business procedures`
                AND p's `the licence was published as Dieu 72(2) requires`
                AND p's `date the insurer notified the Ministry of Finance that these were done` AT MOST (p's `date of official operation` MINUS 15)
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

-- Dieu 73(4), V1 only: no insurance business before the date of official operation. Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(3)
-- replaces Dieu 73 and the new text has no such paragraph (finding F-73).
@@q 1377 1379
@ref Dieu 73 (src:1377-1379)
GIVEN p IS A `Preparation for official operation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 73(4): the business before the date of official operation breaches Dieu 73(4)` p MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN REFUSE "Dieu 73 as replaced by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(3) has no paragraph 4: the express bar on business before official operation is gone from 1 January 2026 (Dieu 9(1) and (2) still bar business without or outside a licence)"
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN p's `carried on insurance business before the date of official operation`
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

§§ `Dieu 74: changes that need approval or notice`

-- Dieu 74(1) and (3). Seven kinds of change need the Ministry's prior written approval; four (V1) or four with
-- the NAME of a branch added (V2, Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(4)) need written notice within 15 days. Anything else:
-- the Law states no step.
@@q 1380 1408
@@qa 70 72
@ref Dieu 74 (src:1380-1408; src:law139-2025-qh15:70-72)
GIVEN c IS A `A change to an insurer`
GIVETH A `A step the Law requires for a change`
`Dieu 74: the step the Law requires for the change` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a change of name or of head office address`    THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a change of charter capital or allocated capital` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a change of content, scope or term of activity` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a transfer of shares taking a holder to or above 10%, or below 10%` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a change of the chair, the chief executive or the actuary` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a division, split, merger, consolidation, dissolution or change of form` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `an investment abroad, including a branch or representative office` THEN `prior written approval of the Ministry of Finance`
    WHEN `a change of the charter or of the rules of a foreign branch` THEN `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
    WHEN `opening, ending or moving a branch or representative office` THEN `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
    WHEN `a change of the name of a branch or representative office`
         THEN IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later` THEN `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change` ELSE `no step stated`
    WHEN `opening, ending or moving a business location` THEN `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`
    WHEN `a change of the beneficial owners` THEN `written notice to the Ministry of Finance within 15 days of the change`

GIVEN `the date of the change` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 74(3): the last day to give written notice` `the date of the change` MEANS
    `the date of the change` PLUS 15

GIVEN `the date the Ministry of Finance approved` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 74(2): the last day for the Ministry of Finance to publish the change` `the date the Ministry of Finance approved` MEANS
    `the date the Ministry of Finance approved` PLUS 10

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 74(4): the Government's rules on the conditions, dossier and procedure of approving and recording changes` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 74(4) delegates the conditions, dossier, order and procedure to the Government; its decree is not among the sources"

§§ `Dieu 75: revoking the licence`

@@q 1413 1435
@ref Dieu 75 (src:1413-1435)
GIVEN g IS A `A ground for revoking a licence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 75(2): the insurer must stop making new contracts at once and transfer its portfolio` g MEANS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `the dossier contained fraudulent information` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `official operation did not begin within the time Dieu 73(1) allows` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the enterprise was divided, merged, consolidated, dissolved or ceased` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the enterprise acted outside the content of its licence` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a court declared the insurer or reinsurer bankrupt` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the foreign parent of a foreign branch was declared bankrupt or lost its licence` THEN TRUE

`Dieu 75(1): the six grounds for revoking a licence are the constructors of A ground for revoking a licence (a statement; each is a fact for the Ministry)` MEANS
    "(a) fraud; (b) no official operation within Dieu 73(1); (c) division, merger, dissolution, cessation; (d) acting outside the licence; (dd) bankruptcy; (e) the foreign parent's bankruptcy or loss of licence."

§§ `Dieu 76 and 77: representative offices of foreign bodies`

@@q 1440 1461
@ref Dieu 76 (src:1440-1461)
GIVEN o IS A `A foreign representative office`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 76: the representative office's activity and term are permitted` o MEANS
        (NOT o's `the activity is business of insurance in Vietnam`)
    AND (   o's `is a liaison office`
         OR o's `is market research`
         OR o's `promotes or monitors the investment projects of the parent`
         OR o's `is another activity consistent with Vietnamese law`)
    AND o's `term of operation in years` AT MOST 5

@@q 1466 1478
@ref Dieu 77 (src:1466-1478)
GIVEN o IS A `A foreign representative office`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 77(1): the foreign body may set up the representative office` o MEANS
    o's `years the parent has operated, latest` AT LEAST 5 AND o's `the home regulator allowed the office`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 76(4) and 77(2): the Minister of Finance's and the Government's rules on reports, changes, licensing of representative offices` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 76(4) delegates reporting to the Minister of Finance and Dieu 77(2) licensing to the Government; neither is among the sources"

§ `Chuong III, Muc 2: To chuc hoat dong`

§§ `Dieu 78: organisation of activity`

@@q 1486 1494
@ref Dieu 78 (src:1486-1494)
`Dieu 78 — the organisation of an insurer at home (head office, branches, representative offices, business locations), abroad (branches, representative offices, other presence) and of a foreign branch (head office, business locations) (a list of forms; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Lists of the units an insurer may have."

§§ `Dieu 79: governance structure`

@@q 1497 1512
@ref Dieu 79 (src:1497-1512)
GIVEN g IS A `A governance structure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 79: the governance structure is one the Law allows` g MEANS
    IF g's `is a joint stock company`
    THEN     (   (    g's `has a general meeting of shareholders, a board and a chief executive`
                  AND g's `has a supervisory board`
                  AND g's `number of controllers on the supervisory board` AT LEAST 3
                  AND g's `number of controllers on the supervisory board` AT MOST 5)
              OR (    g's `has a general meeting of shareholders, a board and a chief executive`
                  AND (NOT g's `has a supervisory board`)
                  AND g's `number of independent board members` AT LEAST g's `number of board members` TIMES 20%
                  AND g's `has an audit committee under the board`))
    ELSE g's `has a members' council and a chief executive`

§§ `Dieu 80: officers and controllers`

@@q 1515 1538
@ref Dieu 80 (src:1515-1538)
`Dieu 80(1)-(3) — the lists of managers of an insurer, managers of a foreign branch, and controllers (definitions of titles; the conditions are Dieu 81 and the posts Dieu 82)` MEANS
    "Three lists of titles."

@@q 1539 1545
@ref Dieu 80 (src:1539-1545)
GIVEN v IS A `A vacancy`
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 80(4): the last day to file a valid dossier for a new chief executive or actuary` v MEANS
    v's `date the chief executive or actuary left office` PLUS 75

GIVEN v IS A `A vacancy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 80(4): the dossier was filed in time` v MEANS
    v's `date the insurer filed a valid dossier for a replacement` AT MOST `Dieu 80(4): the last day to file a valid dossier for a new chief executive or actuary` v

§§ `Dieu 81: conditions and standards for officers`

-- Dieu 81, V1 text (Dieu 81 of the Law as made): general conditions (a)-(b), then board chair and members,
-- chief executive and legal representative, other managers, controllers. V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(5)) replaces
-- the whole article: the general conditions lose "the right to manage enterprises under the Law on Enterprises"
-- (the lead-in no longer lists it); the chief executive's degree route widens to economics, finance, banking, law,
-- business administration, accounting or auditing with an insurance subject; the chief executive's 3 years as
-- manager or controller may be at "an organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking" instead of
-- at an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch; the other managers' degree route widens to any field with an
-- insurance subject; V2 adds that the Minister details the degree rules (Dieu 81(5)).
@@q 1549 1554
@@qa 79 85
@ref Dieu 81 (src:1549-1554; src:law139-2025-qh15:79-85)
GIVEN c IS A `A candidate officer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 81: the general conditions are met` c MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN     c's `has no administrative penalty in insurance`
                AND c's `was not dismissed for breaching internal procedures in the 3 continuous years before the appointment`
                AND c's `is not prosecuted at the time of election or appointment`
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN     c's `holds the right to manage enterprises under the Law on Enterprises`
                AND c's `has no administrative penalty in insurance`
                AND c's `was not dismissed for breaching internal procedures in the 3 continuous years before the appointment`
                AND c's `is not prosecuted at the time of election or appointment`
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

@@q 1557 1568
@@qa 86 100
@ref Dieu 81 (src:1557-1568; src:law139-2025-qh15:86-99)
GIVEN c IS A `A candidate officer`
      `the chair` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 81: the chair or member of the board or members' council meets the conditions` c `the chair` MEANS
        `Dieu 81: the general conditions are met` c
    AND c's `has a university degree or higher`
    AND (IF `the chair`
         THEN c's `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 5 OR c's `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 3
         ELSE c's `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 3 OR c's `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 3)

@@q 1569 1579
@@qa 101 115
@ref Dieu 81 (src:1569-1579; src:law139-2025-qh15:101-115)
GIVEN c IS A `A candidate officer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 81: the chief executive or legal representative meets the conditions` c MEANS
        `Dieu 81: the general conditions are met` c
    AND (IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
         THEN     (   c's `has a degree in insurance`
                   OR c's `has a degree in economics, finance, banking, law, business administration, accounting or auditing that includes an insurance subject`
                   OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate from a lawful training body in Vietnam or abroad`)
              AND c's `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 5
              AND c's `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 3
         ELSE     (   c's `has a degree in insurance`
                   OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate from a lawful training body in Vietnam or abroad`)
              AND c's `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` AT LEAST 5
              AND c's `years as a manager or controller of an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch` AT LEAST 3)
    AND c's `resides in Vietnam while in office`

@@q 1580 1595
@@qa 116 130
@ref Dieu 81 (src:1580-1595; src:law139-2025-qh15:116-130)
GIVEN c IS A `A candidate officer`
      `the manager is the head of a business department` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 81: another manager meets the conditions` c `the manager is the head of a business department` MEANS
        `Dieu 81: the general conditions are met` c
    AND (IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
         THEN     c's `has a degree in insurance`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field that includes an insurance subject`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on`
         ELSE     c's `has a degree in insurance`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on`)
    AND (IF `the manager is the head of a business department`
         THEN c's `years of experience in insurance or the intended specialty` AT LEAST 3
         ELSE c's `years of experience in insurance, finance, banking or the intended specialty` AT LEAST 3)
    AND c's `resides in Vietnam while in office`

@@q 1596 1603
@@qa 132 139
