§ `Chuong III, Muc 3: Kiem soat noi bo, kiem toan noi bo, quan tri rui ro`

-- Dieu 84-86 set duties of internal organisation (build internal-control standards and procedures; an internal audit
-- unit that reviews the internal control every year; a risk management system with a written policy approved by the
-- board). Each is a duty whose breach is a judgement about the adequacy of a system ("hieu qua", "day du", "phu hop"),
-- with no fact a witness could testify to other than the assertion that it was done, and each delegates its detail
-- to the Minister of Finance. They are carried as labelled stubs. The one dated element, Dieu 86(3) (the annual
-- solvency and risk report), takes effect on 1 January 2028 and is listed in law08-ch7-commencement.l4.
@@q 1672 1688
@ref Dieu 84 (src:1672-1688)
`Dieu 84 — internal control: the aims (a)-(c), the standards and procedures, the annual review by internal audit; the Minister of Finance details it (duties of internal organisation; no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Internal control."

@@q 1690 1713
@ref Dieu 85 (src:1690-1713)
`Dieu 85 — internal audit: an insurer or reinsurer must have an internal audit unit; a foreign branch may have one or use its parent's; yearly audit of three kinds of content; results to the board or council and the chief executive; the Minister of Finance details it (no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Internal audit."

@@q 1717 1750
@ref Dieu 86 (src:1717-1750)
`Dieu 86 — risk management: a system to identify, measure, assess, report and control risk; five requirements; an annual solvency and risk management report (khoan 3, from 1 January 2028 by Dieu 156(2)); the Minister of Finance details it (no rule evaluated)` MEANS
    "Risk management."
